{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kI8MF9Z2tws0cZmodCa0Pg?scene=1&click_id=15","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:06.390259+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kI8MF9Z2tws0cZmodCa0Pg?scene=1&click_id=15","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/YgfGyhppzJYjBfYSib094hFedJU29FMOUoD2kHNibzCjlQL09eVSUdmtlAp95ubtmh3ibGlYDoup5RWonibPIyXevA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcgTrxNfxcjthE3O2huyD2XXp5Sibia1ChiaHicoWf6tubIoWAFVfrjG9ceag/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcgULxIjvSqx8oOEtfKx9u6Pp4gyhKTWUM00fchxPlgY0cN1c2eH1Rx9A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请对象</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p></section><section><p><span>2、已获得或预计能获得所就读高校推荐免试攻读硕士研究生资格的2026届全国优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p></section><section><p><span>3、在校期间学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力。</span></p></section><section><p><span>4、诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p></section><p><span>5、申请人具有突出的科研能力与潜质，原则上具有良好的英语应用能力与较好的管理学、数学素养。</span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcgCx5hibMsdibfHnGfOotSRNoJs9KkOhHKT84ESK1uOCdDicMhbzH5kS6tw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>1、本科阶段成绩单1份；</span></p></section><section><p><span>2、国家英语四级或六级考试合格证书复印件1份；</span></p></section><section><p><span>3、申请人还可提交获奖证书、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作效果等材料复印件；</span></p></section><section><p><span>4、参加过院系“夏令营”“暑期学校”“开放日”等活动的证明材料。</span></p></section><p><span>请将上述证明材料制成PDF格式后，压缩成一个zip格式文件并注明</span><strong><span>“姓名-学校-申请专业-联系电话（手机号）”</span></strong><span>后发到指定邮箱。</span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg4WUa5JIPxqiarNibia97mPqZVRlJd300vCwzAxuOhJibf1N6dRJAIH5xKQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请办法</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>1、提交申请材料</span></p></section><section><p><span>有意者请于2025年9月20日前将上述要求的电子材料提交到专用邮箱：</span></p></section><section><p><span>联系电话：0791-83803301  13970924528</span></p></section><p><span><span>材料接受邮箱：372245661@qq.com</span></span></p><section><p><span>2、资格初审</span></p></section><p><span>学院研究生招生领导小组对申请进行初审，确认是否接收申请，并请申请者提供准确联系信息，届时，学院将通知初审合格的申请者来我校参加复试。</span></p><section><p><span>3、复试</span></p></section><section><p><span>复试采取综合面试的方式进行。</span></p></section><p><span>4、考生身体状况应符合国家规定的体检标准(同普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见)。</span></p><section><p><span>5、接受的专业为</span><strong><span>行政管理</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>社会保障</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>土地资源管理</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcgLgUQRStxbQwAKVia3RDWXtnMfuaicQIgXDQjfMtlQbiburehotNSMxoXw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖学金体系</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>全日制硕士研究生奖助体系包括学业奖学金、国家助学金、国家奖学金、江西省政府奖学金、优秀奖学金、单项奖学金、“三助”岗位津贴等多项奖助学金。</span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcgs6u22WYia4ss7ia7tUGEmsjZ8lo8WcYK0msogbjP7JicANUpKI6vBK3Mg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcg6pIrXEkR1UA5pO7h7fybRvKvqJxF0abhA27pHtz7141VM2poyuvNvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1、报名阶段，接受时间从即日起至9月20日止，请有意者尽早报名。</span></p><section><p><span>2、请申请者务必提供自身准确有效的联系方式、联系邮箱，以免错失机会。</span></p></section><p><span>3、申请人必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。我院将对拟录取的推荐免试研究生张榜公示，如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消其录取资格或取消其学籍。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>公共管理学院</span></p><p><span>2025年9月8日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJazRx2dv8PrsjwNKXy6klcgTrxNfxcjthE3O2huyD2XXp5Sibia1ChiaHicoWf6tubIoWAFVfrjG9ceag/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YgfGyhppzJYjBfYSib094hFedJU29FMOUhG3iblXiaTMCJeQJ4zMdDuve935wD776rHX2VpvM2Xle6eyUAuxMyP8g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"eb56154faba46f0e397766b6b007351b795f72e60fe9c10350db57902894159f","textLength":891,"sourceSha256":"14c855e872951fab284ed8b765761fa32a348c8f4886a493f2b62c2fac487248","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-cf5abc3abc78645cde3e","title":"2025年江西财经大学公共管理学院关于接收2026年研究生推免生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:06.390259+00:00"}
